  dataset notes: Population projection based on the general census of 2003. Latest projection for 2025. See caveats. Data available for: 2025, 2022, 2021, 2015
  dataset caveats: [Dataset title changed 2018 05 10] WARNING: The sex disaggregated data (SADD) provided at administrative levels 2 and 3 are derived from the actual administrative level 1 data ratios. While the lower level population data are valid, the sex data will under- or over-count the numbers of females and males. The age disaggregated data provided at administrative levels 1, 2, and 3 are derived from the actual administrative level 0 data ratios. While the lower level population data are valid, the age data will under- or over-count the numbers of children, adults, and elderly.
